cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite Version 0.1.0 of this research repository."
title: "The singular spectrum of a sparse Mertens matrix"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
authors:
  - family-names: Kline
    given-names: Jeffery
repository-code: "https://github.com/jeff-kline/sparse-mertens-singular-spectrum"
url: "https://github.com/jeff-kline/sparse-mertens-singular-spectrum"
license: GPL-3.0-only
abstract: >-
  A paper and release repository describing the singular values of a sparse
  (0,1) matrix whose determinant is the Mertens function: the exact number
  equal to one, the upper values through parent degrees, fixed-index lower
  limits through an explicit compact operator, and an unconditional asymptotic
  equivalent for the smallest singular value in terms of the Mertens sum and
  the norm of a vector of restricted Moebius sums. No improved bound for the
  Mertens function is claimed.
keywords:
  - Mertens function
  - singular values
  - Redheffer matrix
  - Moebius function
  - compact operator
  - Dickman function
references:
  - type: software
    title: "The smallest singular value of a sparse Mertens matrix"
    version: 0.1.0
    doi: 10.5281/zenodo.21774716
    authors:
      - family-names: Kline
        given-names: Jeffery
